        <h2>4. Technical Tables: Propellants, Pressure Ranges, Valves, Containers, and Quality Control</h2>
        <p>Designing a high-performance aerosol system requires precise matching of thermodynamic, material, and quality control specifications. Below are the standard reference tables detailing propellant physical properties, internal pressures, valve configurations, container limits, and mandatory quality checks required in professional aerosol plants.</p>

        <h3>Table 1: Common Aerosol Propellants – Physical &amp; Safety Properties</h3>
